00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:44.840
During the tense days of World War II, an entire American city of men, women, and children

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:51.110
was hidden behind a seemingly unimportant postal number, Box 1663.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:54.180
Today, such secrecy is no longer possible.

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:59.230
Today, this city boldly and proudly parades the normal pattern of American living.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:05.760
This now appears to be an average city of schools and playgrounds, of houses and apartments,

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.900
a place to live where men and women can feel at home.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:13.190
But for all of these things, this city is not an ordinary city.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.970
This is the mile-high city of Los Alamos, the atomic city.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.270
This is a modern Pueblo created by the people of the United States as a research and development center for atomic weapons.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:44.360
This is still a city where citizens take for granted security fences, guards, passes, caution.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:53.250
The proof testing of weapons, a routine practice by now, is the job of a busy section of the Los Alamos laboratory called J Division.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:59.890
With such a specialized division carrying on tests, the other parts of the scientific laboratory...

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:03.520
operated for the Atomic Energy Commission by the University of California,

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.540
can continue undisturbed in vital research and development work.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:12.160
One of the proving grounds for testing weapons is an outdoor laboratory,

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.670
an Iwetok Atoll in the Central Pacific.

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:19.830
This truss territory of the United States has been used before as a testing ground

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.800
for Operation Sandstone in 1948.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.470
But three years have passed in Sandstone.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.970
Three years to bring new and improved atomic weapons to this...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.050
